Day 15 Notes – Introduction to React

What is React?
React is a JavaScript library used to build user interfaces using components.
How to create a React app
npm create vite@latest project-name
Important commands
cd project-name
npm install
npm run dev
Main file
src/App.jsx
Basic Component
function App() {
return (
 
   Hello React
 

);
}
export default App;

Important Rule
Always open the app using http://localhost:5173
Do not open the HTML file directly.

Key Point:
React works with components. App.jsx is your first component.

code;

